  "2026-11-06T19:41:52.056Z",codex-agent,"The complete suite passed 63 tests with 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines over all 9 production modules. Additional review then found and reproduced a criterion-order defect through an actual native SDK round trip: equivalent vectors in a different array order falsely conflicted. Comparison now uses criterion IDs. The new test failed before the fix and passes afterward; all 5 focused core tests pass, and the final gates will recertify the expanded suite."
